<title>ITALY: Italy records bop deficit in December.</title>
<headline>Italy records bop deficit in December.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's overall balance of payments recorded a 2.96 trillion lire deficit in December, the Italian Foreign Exchange Office said.</p>
<p>BALANCE OF PAYMENTS (In billions of lire)</p>
<p>			     Dec 96	  Nov 96    Dec 95</p>
<p> Total		     -2,960	  -4,176   +5,800</p>
<p>  -Year to date	 +19.602	 +23,570   +2,910</p>
<p> Capital movements     -2,812	  -7,212     +899</p>
<p>  -Year to date	  -7,219	  -7,196   -4,756</p>
</text>
